    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d140">

                <pb facs="0158" n="108" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg108"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.24/30</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-14T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                                1918, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2064. Your 2324, February 2, midnight. One million dollars put at disposal
                    military attaché for acquisition supplies and he may so <pb facs="0159" n="109"
                        xml:id="pg109"/> inform his British and French colleagues. Report
                    immediately how fund can be made available in Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
